  <description>Static traffic light (test fixture). Grey pole (r=0.05 m, h=1.80 m) + housing (0.30 x 0.16 x 0.66 m) + three always-on spherical lenses (red/yellow/green, r=0.07 m, top-to-bottom). All dimensions are ASSUMPTIONS. Origin: centre of the pole bottom face (pose z=0 stands on the ground). STATIC MODEL: no runtime switch interface. static=true - test-only.</description>
